PMIS-2025-35005,Wipro Limited,IT and Software Development,Data Entry Operator Intern at Wipro,Administration,Odisha,Bhubaneswar,27,43,Certificate of Completion,"We are seeking a detail-oriented Data Entry Operator Intern. The primary responsibility will be to accurately enter and update data into our computer systems. The intern will be responsible for maintaining data integrity, checking for errors, and ensuring all information is correctly recorded. Key tasks include: transcribing information from paper documents, preparing documents for data entry, reviewing data for errors, and generating reports.",12th Pass,Computer Applications,MS Office,Proficiency in MS Office Suite (Excel and Word); Fast typing speed (30+ WPM); Strong attention to detail.
